<task id="024" project="spaarkeai-assistant-enhancements-r3">
  <metadata>
    <title>Add a thread-preserving bodyOverride param to useEmailComposeActions.openComposer (FR-10 — BINDING invariant)</title>
    <phase>2 — Capability parity</phase>
    <gate>startable</gate>
    <status>pending</status>
    <rigor>FULL</rigor>
    <rigor-reason>Shared email-component .tsx on a data-loss-adjacent invariant (a whole-body-replace drops the quoted thread); dual-mount parity (NFR-05) must not break the standalone sprk_emailpage code page. Auto-FULL on .tsx + reducer test obligation.</rigor-reason>
    <model-tier>opus</model-tier>
    <model-tier-reason>Thread-preservation is a BINDING invariant and data-loss-adjacent; the change sits on the shared email surface consumed by two mounts (SpaarkeAi + standalone code page) and coordinates with email-communication-solution-r5 — judgment-sensitive.</model-tier-reason>
    <effort>xhigh</effort>
    <parallel-group>Wave2-client</parallel-group>
    <parallel-safe>false</parallel-safe>
    <parallel-reason>Edits shared email components (useEmailComposeActions / EmailComposer reducer) — coordinate email-communication-solution-r5 + email-communication-intelligence-r2; must not break the standalone sprk_emailpage mount.</parallel-reason>
